      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here's a workaround:\n\nDownload the new latest YouTube-DL from here: https://yt-dl.org/latest/youtube-dl.exe\n\nGo to C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Steam\\steamapps\\common\\VRChat\\VRChat_Data\\StreamingAssets and rename the \"youtube-dl.exe\" in there to \"youtube-dl_old.exe\". Now drag and drop the latest youtube-dl you downloaded in there, and you should have no issues with playing YouTube videos on players. Note this is only a local fix though.\n\nIt's quite literally as simple as dragging and dropping so I don't know why it's taking so long for the devs to push a hotfix for this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
